  "schemaGap": [
    "weather_forecasts has no expires_at column; Issue #67 must derive expiry from snapshot fetched_at/base policy or add an explicit migration",
    "weather_forecasts has no provider API/guide version column; Issue #67 must project audited snapshot/import metadata without exposing raw payload",
    "weather_forecasts.forecast_type stores ultra_short or short; Issue #67 must project storage short to public village and must never expose short",
    "weather_grid_points permits any KMA grid but the public endpoint supports only rows selected by the Jeju service policy",
    "public schema single source is supabase/migrations; this documentation Issue adds no schema or Flyway",
    "#222 resolves explicit/planned selectors from public and owner-checked records; no user GPS query input"
